# Copy to .env.local for local dev; set the same variables in Netlify
# (Site configuration → Environment variables). Never commit real values.

# The site itself needs none. Mifolio and Matchday have their own sites and repositories now, with
# their own settings: Matchday's ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and MATCHDAY_* limits live with it
# (github.com/xdMikayu/matchday).

# Where /api/finance/* is forwarded while old iPhone Shortcuts still post here (default below).
# MIFOLIO_API_URL=https://mifolio.mikaeelfaraz.com/api/
